{"3855990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Secrets of Salem: The Phantom Cab Collector's Edition", "steam_appid": 3855990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3856310], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855990/extras/f8a96f96aa2901cca530c924ae3681b6.avif?t=1762945956\" width=1156 height=456 /></span>Welcome to the Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure — a story-driven point-and-click experience where you solve mysteries through exploration and puzzles. Players are invited to search for cleverly hidden items in richly detailed scenes, while uncovering secrets through mini-games and logic challenges. It’s the perfect mix of detective work, brain-teasing riddles, and immersive storytelling.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855990/extras/74eef777cee1d4059d6686f816009c6b.poster.avif?t=1762945956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855990/extras/74eef777cee1d4059d6686f816009c6b.webm?t=1762945956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855990/extras/74eef777cee1d4059d6686f816009c6b.mp4?t=1762945956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Detective Victor Grayson thought he’d seen it all, until a string of grisly beheadings linked to a mysterious black taxi draws him back to Salem. When the case echoes the disappearance of his own brother, Victor finds himself partnering with Dakota Lovelace — a witch who knows Salem’s darkest corners. What begins as a hunt for a killer soon becomes a descent into a world where legends breathe, ghosts hold grudges, and every choice could cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step of your investigation is brought to life through engaging gameplay: from scouring atmospheric hidden object scenes to unlocking fresh challenges with original mini-games. Each puzzle is designed to keep you thinking, searching, and unraveling the mysteries piece by piece.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855990/extras/62638222b5597b289bfaf84bc47ec4be.poster.avif?t=1762945956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855990/extras/62638222b5597b289bfaf84bc47ec4be.webm?t=1762945956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855990/extras/62638222b5597b289bfaf84bc47ec4be.mp4?t=1762945956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Immerse yourself in a rich blend of supernatural noir and detective mystery, set in 1950s Salem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Tackle dozens of unique puzzles and mini-games that test both logic and observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Explore eerie streets, haunted places, and hidden corners of Salem as you pursue the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Collect hidden objects and uncover special collectibles along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Shape the outcome of the investigation through meaningful choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Unlock achievements to mark your progress and skill.<br>🔮Enjoy beautifully crafted artwork, enchanting wallpapers, and a hauntingly atmospheric soundtrack.<br><br>Step into the shadows, follow the clues, and uncover the truth behind Salem’s most chilling legend. The ride is waiting — but will you survive it?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/